4,"text":"llama, and we partner with"},{"start":128.23,"duration":4.04,"text":"major model labs and hardware"},{"start":130.23,"duration":4.1,"text":"companies to continue to bring"},{"start":132.33,"duration":4.1,"text":"model launches and hardware"},{"start":134.4,"duration":4.07,"text":"optimizations to llama. So just"},{"start":136.5,"duration":3.7,"text":"this morning, Google DeepMind"},{"start":138.54,"duration":3.87,"text":"announced Gemma for 12 B"},{"start":140.27,"duration":4.24,"text":"unified model, and it's already"},{"start":142.47,"duration":4.07,"text":"available on llama, and you can"},{"start":144.58,"duration":7.78,"text":"use it for your genetic"},{"start":146.61,"duration":7.57,"text":"applications. And recently,"},{"start":152.42,"duration":3.77,"text":"starting this year, we added"},{"start":154.25,"duration":3.94,"text":"Llamas Cloud to augment the"},{"start":156.26,"duration":3.94,"text":"local inference piece as well."},{"start":158.26,"duration":3.94,"text":"And this is a piece where your"},{"start":160.26,"duration":3.94,"text":"data is never trained on. It"},{"start":162.26,"duration":4.04,"text":"has zero data retention. What"},{"start":164.26,"duration":4.1,"text":"it's meant to do is being able"},{"start":166.37,"duration":4.17,"text":"to run frontier models on data"},{"start":168.43,"duration":3.84,"text":"center grade hardware. And this"},{"start":170.6,"duration":3.6,"text":"way, if you don't have the"},{"start":172.34,"duration":4.04,"text":"compute locally, you're able to"},{"start":174.27,"duration":3.94,"text":"scale with llama and continue"},{"start":176.44,"duration":3.94,"text":"to run the models that you want."},{"start":178.28,"duration":4.1,"text":"And a lot of these use cases"},{"start":180.45,"duration":4.14,"text":"that are enabled with llama are"},{"start":182.45,"duration":4.14,"text":"things like parallel agents to"},{"start":184.65,"duration":3.57,"text":"really accomplish difficult"},{"start":186.65,"duration":3.5