uration":5.57,"text":"way you would use a local model."},{"start":504.6,"duration":4.2,"text":"So as Michael mentioned, we"},{"start":507.01,"duration":3.84,"text":"introduced llama launch earlier"},{"start":508.88,"duration":4.1,"text":"this year. And essentially it's"},{"start":510.91,"duration":4.04,"text":"a way to connect to all your"},{"start":513.04,"duration":5.57,"text":"favorite tools and applications"},{"start":515.01,"duration":4.2,"text":"for whatever you'd like to do."},{"start":518.68,"duration":3.97,"text":"So we support personal agents"},{"start":519.28,"duration":5.27,"text":"like Open Claw Hermes, as well"},{"start":522.72,"duration":3.84,"text":"as a plethora of agentic"},{"start":524.62,"duration":4.17,"text":"harnesses to do coding agents"},{"start":526.63,"duration":5.94,"text":"and coding work. So here's a"},{"start":528.86,"duration":5.94,"text":"list. We have cloud code, Codex,"},{"start":532.63,"duration":4.3,"text":"copilot, CLI, droid Pi, and"},{"start":534.87,"duration":5.91,"text":"many, many more. And many more"},{"start":537.0,"duration":5.84,"text":"are also coming. So I'll show"},{"start":540.84,"duration":5.74,"text":"you a little bit about how it's"},{"start":542.91,"duration":4.24,"text":"super easy to plug llama into"},{"start":546.65,"duration":2.1,"text":"any of these favorite tools"},{"start":547.21,"duration":5.37,"text":"that you may have. And I'll"},{"start":548.81,"duration":6.17,"text":"showcase copilot in this case."},{"start":552.65,"duration":4.1,"text":"So as I mentioned earlier, you"},{"start":555.05,"duration":3.8,"text":"just type llama launch copilot,"},{"start":556.82,"duration":3.94,"text":"and you can pick the model that"},{"start":558.92,"duration":5.67,"text":"you'd like. So in this case I'm"},{"start":560.83,"duration":5.77,"text":"using Kimmy K 2.6 on our cloud,"},{"start":564.66,"duration":4.07,"text":"but just as easily you can use"},{"start":566.67,"duration":3.94,"text":"a local model as well. And one"},{"start":568.8,"duration":2.4,"text":"of the things I really like"},{"start":570.67,"duration":2.3,"text":"about the copilot CLI is that"},{"start":571.27,"duration":3.47,"text":"you can directly pick which"},{"start":573.04,"duration":3.67,"text":"issues you want to work on. And"},{"start":574.81,"duration":3.9,"text":"so in this case, I'm like, okay,"},{"start":576.78,"duration":4.2,"text":"go and fetch this issue. Let's"},{"start":578.78,"duration":5.84,"text":"see what it's doing and let's"},{"start":581.05,"duration":5.84,"text":"come up with a solution for it."},{"start":584.68,"duration":4.1,"text":"So it's thinking likes to think"},{"start":586.95,"duration":2.4,"text":"a lot sometimes. And you know,"},{"start":588.85,"duration":2.2,"text":"it's come up with exactly"},{"start":589.42,"duration":3.57,"text":"what's going on in the issue."},{"start":591.12,"duration":3.8,"text":"And I can use this as part of"},{"start":593.06,"duration":3.57,"text":"my workflow to directly without"},{"start":594.99,"duration":3.8,"text":"ever leaving my terminal and"},{"start":596.7,"duration":4.04,"text":"leveraging these open models to"},{"start":598.86,"duration":3.77,"text":"do real work. And this is a"},{"start":600.8,"duration":4.1,"text":"workflow that I'd often do in"},{"start":602.7,"duration":4.2,"text":"my day to day. So I ask, are"},{"start":604.97,"duration":3.97,"text":"there any open PRS referencing"},{"start":606.97,"duration":3.9,"text":"it? It says no, and then we"},{"start":609.01,"duration":3.9,"text":"start working on a fix. And so"},{"start":610.94,"duration":3.9,"text":"any other agent harnesses that"},{"start":612.98,"duration":4.1,"text":"you've, you know, used llama"},{"start":614.91,"duration":4.17,"text":"powers them similarly as well,"},{"start":617.15,"duration":3.84,"text":"where we make sure that the"},{"start":619.15,"duration":3.44,"text":"underlying technologies work,"},{"start":621.05,"duration":3.6,"text":"things like subagents, web"},{"start":622.65,"duration":2.64,"text":"search, etc. So over here, it's"},{"start":624.72,"duration":2.2,"text":"spun up multiple subagents to"},{"start":625.36,"duration":3.3,"text":"go and explore the code base"},{"start":626.99,"duration":4.1,"text":"and come up with potential"},{"start":628.73,"duration":4.3,"text":"fixes. Just skipping forward a"},{"start":631.16,"duration":3.67,"text":"little bit basically gives me a"},{"start":633.1,"duration":3.74,"text":"little bit of a plan, and then"},{"start":634.9,"duration":6.01,"text":"I can execute on this plan and"},{"start":636.9,"duration":7.88,"text":"get my work done. Another thing"},{"start":640.97,"duration":5.97,"text":"I feel is so critical is this"},{"start":644.84,"duration":3.84,"text":"idea of hybrid execution. So"},{"start":647.01,"duration":2.3,"text":"cloud models, especially the"},{"start":648.75,"duration":2.37,"text":"ones that we serve, which are"},{"start":649.38,"duration":3.47,"text":"very, very close to frontier"},{"start":651.18,"duration":5.51,"text":"level intelligence, they are"},{"start":652.92,"duration":5.84,"text":"awesome. For your most"},{"start":656.76,"duration":3.94,"text":"difficult work when it comes to"},{"start":658.82,"duration":2.44,"text":"coding or any other agentic"},{"start":660.76,"duration":2.33,"text":"tasks, but there's a lot of"},{"start":661.33,"duration":3.64,"text":"stuff you want to be extremely,"},{"start":663.16,"duration":3.6,"text":"extremely private for. And this"},{"start":665.03,"duration":3.87,"text":"is a workflow that I often use"},{"start":666.83,"duration":4.1,"text":"in my day to day or quarterly,"},{"start":668.97,"duration":3.87,"text":"as you'll see, which is my"},{"start":671.0,"duration":2.44,"text":"credit card statement. And so"},{"start":672.9,"duration":2.3,"text":"this is not my actual credit"},{"start":673.51,"duration":3.34,"text":"card statement. That would be a"},{"start":675.27,"duration":3.7,"text":"little bit weird, but it is a"},{"start":676.91,"duration":3.8,"text":"fake one. And so this is some,"},{"start":679.04,"duration":3.77,"text":"this is a pretty usual workflow"},{"start":680.78,"duration":4.1,"text":"I'll do at the end of every"},{"start":682.88,"duration":4.07,"text":"month. I'll basically go take"},{"start":684.95,"duration":4.21,"text":"my credit card statement and"},{"start":687.02,"duration":3.97,"text":"put it into one of my favorite"},{"start":689.22,"duration":3.64,"text":"harnesses called pi. So pi is a"},{"start":691.06,"duration":3.67,"text":"really minimal harness if you"},{"start":692.92,"duration":3.8,"text":"haven't heard about it. And"},{"start":694.79,"duration":4.0,"text":"it's perfect for local models"},{"start":696.8,"duration":2.67,"text":"as the entire point is that it"},{"start":698.86,"duration":2.27,"text":"doesn't bloat the system prompt,"},{"start":699.53,"duration":3.47,"text":"it keeps everything super"},{"start":701.2,"duration":3.94,"text":"minimal. So in this case, I'm"},{"start":703.07,"duration":3.97,"text":"using 3.6 running locally on my"},{"start":705.2,"duration":3.77,"text":"MacBook, and I'm basically"},{"start":707.11,"duration":5.74,"text":"going to say, you know, process"},{"start":709.04,"duration":4.44,"text":"this statement and show me kind"},{"start":712.91,"duration":2.27,"text":"of how much I'm spending, what"},{"start":713.55,"duration":5.21,"text":"are the different categories."},{"start":715.25,"duration":4.04,"text":"And so let's see it in action."},{"start":718.82,"duration":2.23,"text":"So this is running fully"},{"start":719.35,"duration":5.37,"text":"locally on my computer for my"},{"start":721.12,"duration":5.91,"text":"most private and private use"},{"start":724.79,"duration":4.1,"text":"cases. And in this case it's"},{"start":727.09,"duration":3.8,"text":"able to write code to process"},{"start":728.96,"duration":2.5,"text":"the PDF. And now it's able to"},{"start":730.96,"duration":2.2,"text":"give me a little bit of a"},{"start":731.53,"duration":3.47,"text":"spending breakdown because it's"},{"start":733.23,"duration":9.54,"text":"not processed that information."},{"start":735.07,"duration":8.31,"text":"So let's see. It's doing a bit"},{"start":742.84,"duration":2.27,"text":"of math to figure out exactly"},{"start":743.44,"duration":3.57,"text":"what's going on. And then there"},{"start":745.18,"duration":2.37,"text":"we go. So none of this"},{"start":747.08,"duration":2.04,"text":"information ever left my"},{"start":747.61,"duration":3.5,"text":"computer. It's been here. It"},{"start":749.18,"duration":3.8,"text":"seems like I'm spending a lot"},{"start":751.18,"duration":5.61,"text":"on travel. Guess I'm overdue"},{"start":753.05,"duration":4.3,"text":"for another vacation. But I"},{"start":756.86,"duration":2.23,"text":"think it's really, really"},{"start":757.42,"duration":3.44,"text":"useful to be able to have this"},{"start":759.16,"duration":3.7,"text":"level of like, good enough. And"},{"start":760.93,"duration":3.87,"text":"a big thing we've seen over the"},{"start":762.93,"duration":4.07,"text":"last few months is that you"},{"start":764.86,"duration":4.17,"text":"truly have this idea where"},{"start":767.07,"duration":5.74,"text":"local models are actually"},{"start":769.1,"duration":4.34,"text":"viable to do real work. And"},{"start":772.87,"duration":2.13,"text":"another really cool thing that"},{"start":773.51,"duration":3.6,"text":"I personally really like using"},{"start":775.07,"duration":4.17,"text":"is using local models for"},{"start":777.18,"duration":4.04,"text":"personal harnesses. So personal"},{"start":779.31,"duration":3.87,"text":"agents like Hermes and Open"},{"start":781.28,"duration":3.8,"text":"Claw, because none of your"},{"start":783.25,"duration":3.64,"text":"information ever leaves and you"},{"start":785.15,"duration":2.27,"text":"can kind of start feeding it"},{"start":786.95,"duration":3.87,"text":"information. Everything's"},{"start":787.49,"duration":5.41,"text":"living on your computer anyways."},{"start":790.89,"duration":4.04,"text":"And so I'd love to show you"},{"start":792.96,"duration":3.87,"text":"open claw. One of the cool"},{"start":794.99,"duration":4.27,"text":"things that we can do with open"},{"start":796.9,"duration":4.27,"text":"claw is install it for you. And"},{"start":799.33,"duration":3.77,"text":"so this is like a complete end"},{"start":801.23,"duration":3.7,"text":"to end setup. I wrote a launch"},{"start":803.17,"duration":3.74,"text":"open claw ran it. It's"},{"start":805.0,"duration":5.97,"text":"installing open claw lets me"},{"start":806.97,"duration":6.07,"text":"choose a model and gets me set"},{"start":811.04,"duration":4.1,"text":"up right with it. And so within"},{"start":813.11,"duration":3.97,"text":"like 30s, I'm able to go from"},{"start":815.21,"duration":4.0,"text":"absolutely nothing installed to"},{"start":817.15,"duration":5.71,"text":"and running open claw instance"},{"start":819.28,"duration":9.78,"text":"ready to do my work for me."},{"start":822.92,"duration":8.04,"text":"Cool. And with that, we'd like"},{"start":829.13,"duration":3.74,"text":"to open up the floor for any"},{"start":831.03,"duration":5.91,"text":"questions that you may have"},{"start":832.93,"duration":5.94,"text":"around local cloud Olama. So"},{"start":837.0,"duration":3.87,"text":"welcome to come up to the mic"},{"start":838.94,"duration":5.94,"text":"and then we'll also hang around"},{"start":840.94,"duration":6.34,"text":"after. Yeah as well. Yeah."},{"start":844.94,"duration":4.4,"text":"Hello. It's working. Well, I"},{"start":847.35,"duration":5.64,"text":"was wondering, since the focus"},{"start":849.41,"duration":4.1,"text":"is on this, part of the focus"},{"start":853.05,"duration":2.1,"text":"was on running on devices."},{"start":853.59,"duration":3.4,"text":"Sorry. Would you be able to"},{"start":855.22,"duration":4.07,"text":"speak louder? Sure. I'll try."},{"start":857.06,"duration":4.24,"text":"So I was wondering, since part"},{"start":859.36,"duration":3.84,"text":"of the focus is on running on"},{"start":861.36,"duration":3.77,"text":"the device itself, what are"},{"start":863.26,"duration":3.97,"text":"your thoughts on edge devices"},{"start":865.2,"duration":5.71,"text":"like mobile phones or smaller"},{"start":867.3,"duration":7.74,"text":"systems that may not have the"},{"start":870.97,"duration":4.67,"text":"same power as a laptop? Sorry,"},{"start":875.11,"duration":3.8,"text":"just to repeat the question,"},{"start":875.71,"duration":3.8,"text":"did you mean what type of"},{"start":878.98,"duration":2.27,"text":"models are good for different"},{"start":879.58,"duration":5.34,"text":"systems? I'm not necessarily"},{"start":881.31,"duration":4.24,"text":"what type of models, but"},{"start":884.98,"duration":2.27,"text":"specifically if there are plans"},{"start":885.62,"duration":5.3,"text":"to have olama integrations"},{"start":887.32,"duration":5.61,"text":"directly at the edge for, again,"},{"start":890.99,"duration":2.54,"text":"maybe iPhones or Android"},{"start":892.99,"duration":3.94,"text":"devices that may not have the"},{"start":893.59,"duration":5.51,"text":"same power as your regular Mac."},{"start":897.0,"duration":2.7,"text":"Yeah, we haven't targeted"},{"start":899.16,"duration":3.77,"text":"mobile devices yet. There are"},{"start":899.76,"duration":3.8,"text":"people who have experimenting,"},{"start":903.0,"duration":2.23,"text":"being experimenting bringing"},{"start":903.64,"duration":5.44,"text":"olama on mobile devices, and it"},{"start":905.3,"duration":5.81,"text":"does run so absolutely enabled"},{"start":909.14,"duration":2.64,"text":"on Qualcomm Snapdragon devices."},{"start":911.18,"duration":2.2,"text":"And it's the same chipset that"},{"start":911.84,"duration":5.11,"text":"runs on mobile. And we have"},{"start":913.45,"duration":4.04,"text":"seen users do that. We're not"},{"start":917.02,"duration":2.07,"text":"directly targeting mobile"},{"start":917.55,"duration":3.57,"text":"devices yet because we want to"},{"start":919.15,"duration":7.91,"text":"target the mainstream use cases"},{"start":921.19,"duration":7.91,"text":"for work. Thank you. Any other"},{"start":927.13,"duration":3.94,"text":"questions? Feel free to hop on"},{"start":929.16,"duration":2.5,"text":"to the mic or raise your hand"},{"start":931.13,"duration":7.84,"text":"and we'll guide you over. Oh,"},{"start":931.73,"duration":9.24,"text":"do you want to go up to the mic?"},{"start":939.04,"duration":4.2,"text":"Yeah. Can you talk a little bit"},{"start":941.04,"duration":4.2,"text":"about Vram and unified RAM and"},{"start":943.31,"duration":5.67,"text":"sort of model sizes, context"},{"start":945.31,"duration":5.67,"text":"windows? I'm I saw that at"},{"start":949.05,"duration":4.14,"text":"least in the demo, you had a"},{"start":951.05,"duration":2.74,"text":"262 K context window. What kind"},{"start":953.25,"duration":2.2,"text":"of a machine do you have and"},{"start":953.85,"duration":5.14,"text":"what are the specs. Yeah. Is it"},{"start":955.52,"duration":5.47,"text":"a quantized model for sure. So"},{"start":959.06,"duration":2.5,"text":"obviously like in llama, we"},{"start":961.06,"duration":3.94,"text":"have a default quantization"},{"start":961.63,"duration":5.37,"text":"that we recommend for most"},{"start":965.06,"duration":2.47,"text":"things. And now we also have"},{"start":967.07,"duration":4.04,"text":"support for ML where we"},{"start":967.6,"duration":5.67,"text":"actually run Nphp4. And with"},{"start":971.17,"duration":4.07,"text":"all that I have a maxed out Mac."},{"start":973.34,"duration":2.47,"text":"So I can run a full context"},{"start":975.31,"duration":1.97,"text":"length, especially with a"},{"start":975.87,"duration":3.5,"text":"smaller model and get most of"},{"start":977.34,"duration":3.87,"text":"my work done and not really"},{"start":979.45,"duration":3.97,"text":"have to worry about compaction"},{"start":981.28,"duration":3.74,"text":"as much. Because what tends to"},{"start":983.48,"duration":3.6,"text":"happen as soon as you're"},{"start":985.08,"duration":3.94,"text":"running a workloads locally is"},{"start":987.15,"duration":2.47,"text":"you start running into being"},{"start":989.09,"duration":2.27,"text":"hardware constraint where you"},{"start":989.69,"duration":3.54,"text":"can't support the maximum"},{"start":991.42,"duration":3.6,"text":"context length. So unified"},{"start":993.29,"duration":3.87,"text":"memory is great in the sense"},{"start":995.09,"duration":3.94,"text":"that it lets you have larger"},{"start":997.23,"duration":3.9,"text":"context lengths with a slight"},{"start":999.1,"duration":4.14,"text":"trade off of that speed that"},{"start":1001.2,"duration":4.14,"text":"you would get on a Cuda card,"},{"start":1003.3,"duration":3.94,"text":"for example. But at the same"},{"start":1005.4,"duration":3.97,"text":"time, you get to work a lot"},{"start":1007.31,"duration":4.07,"text":"more with a larger memory. So"},{"start":1009.44,"duration":4.07,"text":"you get to support harder and"},{"start":1011.44,"duration":4.07,"text":"harder tasks. And I'm sure that"},{"start":1013.58,"duration":3.84,"text":"as time goes on, even unified"},{"start":1015.58,"duration":3.67,"text":"memory will get better in terms"},{"start":1017.48,"duration":3.57,"text":"of performance and speed. And"},{"start":1019.32,"duration":3.74,"text":"on the hardware front, we've"},{"start":1021.12,"duration":2.54,"text":"been seeing most of the"},{"start":1023.12,"duration":2.2,"text":"hardware partners are getting"},{"start":1023.72,"duration":3.67,"text":"into unified memory. Started"},{"start":1025.39,"duration":3.9,"text":"with Apple. Nvidia and"},{"start":1027.46,"duration":3.87,"text":"Microsoft just announced RTX"},{"start":1029.36,"duration":4.17,"text":"spark that has unified memory"},{"start":1031.4,"duration":4.14,"text":"up to 128GB. Of course, AMD has"},{"start":1033.6,"duration":5.64,"text":"the strict Halo platform that"},{"start":1035.6,"duration":5.61,"text":"also can go up to 128GB, I"},{"start":1039.3,"duration":3.77,"text":"believe. And so we're seeing"},{"start":1041.27,"duration":2.4,"text":"across the board different"},{"start":1043.14,"duration":6.01,"text":"hardware teams moving towards"},{"start":1043.74,"duration":5.94,"text":"unified memory. Hey, I'm"},{"start":1049.21,"duration":4.0,"text":"building on Apple silicon"},{"start":1049.75,"duration":7.34,"text":"devices, building on device"},{"start":1053.29,"duration":5.87,"text":"platform for models that are"},{"start":1057.16,"duration":5.94,"text":"running on iPhone and Mac OS"},{"start":1059.22,"duration":7.88,"text":"and Vision Pro, also watch OS,"},{"start":1063.16,"duration":5.94,"text":"I tried a couple weeks back."},{"start":1067.17,"duration":3.97,"text":"Are you still using llama CPU"},{"start":1069.17,"duration":4.24,"text":"under the hood? Any plan to"},{"start":1071.2,"duration":5.97,"text":"build your own inference engine,"},{"start":1073.47,"duration":5.74,"text":"by the way? So we do have our"},{"start":1077.24,"duration":3.87,"text":"own ML inference engine. So if"},{"start":1079.28,"duration":3.84,"text":"you are on an Apple device,"},{"start":1081.18,"duration":3.94,"text":"highly recommend using that one."},{"start":1083.18,"duration":4.0,"text":"Just because you get faster"},{"start":1085.18,"duration":3.94,"text":"performance. And for that, you"},{"start":1087.25,"duration":5.87,"text":"just need to pull one of the ML"},{"start":1089.19,"duration":9.94,"text":"models from our model registry."},{"start":1093.19,"duration":10.01,"text":"Thank you. Any other questions?"},{"start":1099.2,"duration":8.17,"text":"Yeah. Yep. 128 gigabyte Mac is"},{"start":1103.27,"duration":5.97,"text":"the most powerful. Sure. So the"},{"start":1107.44,"duration":5.71,"text":"question was what's the best"},{"start":1109.31,"duration":4.4,"text":"coding model on 128 gigabyte"},{"start":1113.21,"duration":3.94,"text":"MacBook? Honestly, one of my"},{"start":1113.78,"duration":5.5,"text":"favorites is 13627 B, if I'm"},{"start":1117.22,"duration":5.94,"text":"remembering correctly, as well"},{"start":1119.35,"duration":4.4,"text":"as Gemma, I kind of use them in"},{"start":1123.22,"duration":2.33,"text":"pairs to go and write like"},{"start":1123.82,"duration":5.47,"text":"smaller scripts for me for the"},{"start":1125.62,"duration":4.3,"text":"most part, honestly, like a"},{"start":1129.36,"duration":3.8,"text":"little bit underrated, but even"},{"start":1129.99,"duration":7.17,"text":"the gpt2 SS120B works really"},{"start":1133.23,"duration":7.94,"text":"well for doing scripting and"},{"start":1137.24,"duration":6.07,"text":"other tasks. Yeah. Cool."},{"start":1141.24,"duration":4.0,"text":"Awesome. I was going to add the"},{"start":1143.38,"duration":3.87,"text":"Gemma for dense models are"},{"start":1145.31,"duration":4.3,"text":"actually really performant, and"},{"start":1147.31,"duration":4.04,"text":"you'd be able to run them on a"},{"start":1149.68,"duration":7.61,"text":"full context length as well."},{"start":1151.42,"duration":7.78,"text":"Yeah. So overwhelmed by yeah."},{"start":1157.36,"duration":2.47,"text":"So, so the question is like,"},{"start":1159.26,"duration":3.94,"text":"how do you choose which model"},{"start":1159.89,"duration":5.3,"text":"to use? It really depends on"},{"start":1163.26,"duration":4.04,"text":"kind of your task for coding."},{"start":1165.26,"duration":2.6,"text":"You know, different models will"},{"start":1167.37,"duration":3.84,"text":"perform better versus like"},{"start":1167.93,"duration":3.87,"text":"personal agents sometimes, or"},{"start":1171.27,"duration":2.1,"text":"even if you're just using for"},{"start":1171.87,"duration":2.07,"text":"like a chat use case or"},{"start":1173.44,"duration":3.97,"text":"classification for whatever"},{"start":1174.01,"duration":5.54,"text":"reason. And a big way that I"},{"start":1177.48,"duration":3.97,"text":"recommend people to go about"},{"start":1179.61,"duration":3.8,"text":"choosing a model is honestly"},{"start":1181.51,"duration":3.94,"text":"like trying a bunch out. We're"},{"start":1183.48,"duration":2.57,"text":"going to start doing better"},{"start":1185.52,"duration":2.14,"text":"recommendations in terms of,"},{"start":1186.12,"duration":3.34,"text":"you know, if you're using a"},{"start":1187.72,"duration":3.64,"text":"certain harness as part of a"},{"start":1189.52,"duration":3.77,"text":"llama launch, you'd be able to"},{"start":1191.42,"duration":3.94,"text":"see kind of which are the up"},{"start":1193.36,"duration":3.87,"text":"and date models, which you can"},{"start":1195.43,"duration":3.97,"text":"use best for your system as"},{"start":1197.3,"duration":2.74,"text":"well. But for the most part, if"},{"start":1199.46,"duration":2.2,"text":"you're building like a bespoke"},{"start":1200.1,"duration":3.44,"text":"app, then the best thing you"},{"start":1201.73,"duration":3.67,"text":"can do is try a bunch out,"},{"start":1203.6,"duration":5.64,"text":"benchmark it, and see which one"},{"start":1205.47,"duration":5.77,"text":"you prefer the most. Yeah. And"},{"start":1209.31,"duration":2.54,"text":"I think with that, we'll"},{"start":1211.31,"duration":2.17,"text":"conclude this session. We're"},{"start":1211.91,"duration":3.47,"text":"going to hang around for a"},{"start":1213.55,"duration":1.83,"text":"while. Come chat with us. W"}]}